{"overview":"نو جی‑ووک، دادستان دفتر دادستانی ناحیه مرکزی، پس از یک اتفاق دوران کودکی که شامل والدین و اولین عشقش می‌شود، شغل خود را به وکیل خصوصی تغییر می‌دهد. یون بونگ‑هی، ورزشکار تائیکواندو در دوران جوانی، کارآموز دادستانی است که به عنوان مظنون به قتل شناخته می‌شود. هر دو، یون بونگ‑هی و نو جی‑ووک، به هدف یک قاتل تبدیل می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Noh Ji-Wook is a prosecutor in the Central District Prosecutors’ Office who ends up switching professions to a private attorney. He harbors a trauma stemming from an event in his childhood involving his parents and his first love. Eun Bong-Hee, a Taekwondo athlete in her youth, is a prosecutor trainee who has become a murder suspect. Eun Bong-Hee and Noh Ji-Wook both find themselves being the focus of a killer.","tagline_en":"","runtime":35,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":40,"y":2017,"poster":"/xeUZi1RfqKHHhsaBoGkJBu95LvN.jpg"}],"episodes":40,"crew":["박선호"],"crew_en":["Park Seon-ho"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"지창욱","role":"Noh Ji-wook","photo":"/sBmHrO5Tn27Ot5hy0yAKniROmNb.jpg","en":"Ji Chang-wook"},{"name":"남지현","role":"Eun Bong-hee","photo":"/dSFP974u2btrs44Ynw0osCTDBtH.jpg","en":"Nam Ji-hyun"},{"name":"최태준","role":"Ji Eun-hyuk","photo":"/8ke10xg4YHqyWOyynnE917OW1xt.jpg","en":"Choi Tae-joon"},{"name":"권나라","role":"Cha Yoo-jung","photo":"/4U0cNinwOf7DdsBYA3BFi7arDmz.jpg","en":"Kwon Na-ra"},{"name":"동하","role":"Jung Hyun-soo","photo":"/ueuDkgp3KyWyhfXos2BMp9Git1b.jpg","en":"Dong Ha"},{"name":"김예원","role":"Na Ji-hae","photo":"/iG7ygQ6k7hqbs3b2iMgOjVkuMsN.jpg","en":"Kim Ye-won"},{"name":"이덕화","role":"Byeon Young-hee","photo":"/ysB2JatlYtEHffdujEn7BZuNRXU.jpg","en":"Lee Duck-hwa"},{"name":"장혁진","role":"Bang Gye-jang","photo":"/gBI4xgvtCBLTLz25jA6JgB0xccd.jpg","en":"Jang Hyuk-jin"},{"name":"남기애","role":"Hong Bok-ja","photo":"/5sDZDAAxgJVAi4fxfgKVKD6owaw.jpg","en":"Nam Gi-ae"},{"name":"윤복인","role":"Park Young-soon","photo":"/9CiNvnElsevAhExlMh6bzapbY8w.jpg","en":"Yoon Bok-in"},{"name":